From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] soc: mediatek: implement bounded MT6897 VCP transport

Inspect the bootloader VCP metadata and implement bounded transport,
secure reset/clock ordering, logger and explicit power ownership.
Keep the imported codec source separate from this MT6897 platform layer.

